Why Meta=E2=80=99s big American backlash happened in court

A blockbuster case against Meta went to trial a week ago in Oakland, Califo=
rnia, just north of the US tech company=E2=80=99s headquarters in Silicon V=
alley. California and 28 other US states are suing the =C2=A31tn ($1.36tn) =
company for allegedly designing products that are addictive for children, a=
nd hiding that information from the public.

The courtroom has already seen minor fireworks. On the witness stand, a whi=
stleblower who worked extensively with Mark Zuckerberg accused the CEO of l=
ying to the public about his commitment to child safety. The prosecutor who=
 opened the case framed her argument around four words that start with the =
letter H: Meta =E2=80=9Chooks=E2=80=9D in users, =E2=80=9Cholds=E2=80=9D th=
em on its platforms for as long as possible, =E2=80=9Charvests=E2=80=9D the=
ir data and then =E2=80=9Chides=E2=80=9D the truth from the public. She con=
tended that this business model =E2=80=9Cworked especially well for kids=E2=
=80=9D. More pyrotechnics are expected. Zuckerberg himself is expected to f=
ace tough questions on the stand, as is the CEO of Instagram.

Meta has denied all allegations. Liza Crenshaw, a spokesperson for the comp=
any, said: =E2=80=9CRather than sticking to the facts or the law, the state=
s have instead decided to chase an outlandish payout.=E2=80=9D

The trial presents a major challenge for Meta, not in the least, because in=
 the United States, it=E2=80=99s proceedings like these that regulate the t=
ech industry.

China regulates tech by crackdown; the UK and Europe regulate the industry =
with legislation =E2=80=93 Brussels=E2=80=99 prescriptive stipulations have=
 become global defaults. But in the US, it=E2=80=99s mostly the courts that=
 set the boundaries. They move much faster and with the vindictive authorit=
y that Americans often crave in response to harms. The slow wheels of democ=
ratic debate and bill drafting feel ill-suited to respond to Zuckerberg=E2=
=80=99s mantra of =E2=80=9Cmove fast and break things=E2=80=9D.

