GxAO5copUZuqsBOr5iq1JiVjLD4yRyrKKZpzEz5GQBw" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">One =
of east coast=E2=80=99s largest datacenters accused of =E2=80=98violating f=
ederal law=E2=80=99</a></strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Palihapitiya argues the backlash will grow=
.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">=E2=80=9CData centers have unfortunately b=
ecome THE symbolic representation of the asymmetric upside for a very narro=
w tech elite and a class that are untrustworthy. Inasmuch, the safer bet ma=
y be that the pushback and resistance grows=E2=80=A6=E2=80=9D he wrote.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The technorati on X seem to have recently =
woken up to the new hostile political reality, and over the weekend spilled=
 some ink bristling at it. Many rejected the backlash as myopic, shallow, a=
nd short-lived. =E2=80=9CAny politician opposed to data centers is unqualif=
ied to hold public office,=E2=80=9D Gavin Baker, an influential venture cap=
italist, <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.QvkQ=
tXiSzSINXrMyEJiuYu_rizLmeuU2rskcPLinjsLS76DrXheDhU-J7gflQMyP_w_B2DNTeJob-uD=
CvWnG9b40iEHyFIAqkKYgHp2hRp45qQ5FLmXk9vwU7FI0fo1WYHajxEYbM8mTh0a7tN17KWHk6n=
B_dFm-nFtJjDa7YrEV7WxdvmGTrC8poKrbf6hR-cc9A73TCAkp6XuEav_ciRSI1c_Kf1XsjLDxf=
veMOFKYD-Q2PZ7ZTdOCa22L9lGk/4to/Myvj0_Q8T8SBLcFS8LXkeA/h30/h001.cCr7drMC__c=
h9XoXAvaa-kUkkSOvFnIarxrKtC4-Zi4" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">tweeted</a> on =
Saturday.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">On Monday, Donald Trump weighed in. =E2=80=
=9CLet data reign,=E2=80=9D he wrote on Truth Social</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Truth Social users answered the president=
=E2=80=99s post en masse and with uncharacteristic rage.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">As these battles reach a boil in the US, t=
hey=E2=80=99re heating up in other parts of the world. <a href=3D"https://a=
blink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMg=
szcCSneHEAuG0RqCca7fIwka-i3erzpnJDVWnpZhR9KX4PiNIndEWGQ_gePFrpGk27X1Tuc77L7=
MCPXe3BUlS7a2e30RulgIO61bJqiUiuTc6kF917lD3A19PrXZRYvjywCOirCJJIKjirKuVF1Bnq=
