XKtQve1xQ/4to/Myvj0_Q8T8SBLcFS8LXkeA/h31/h001.w29breUfNhXdTdLZXOHg-e-X87efV=
skpZnzRQB_5W0k" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Scotland</a> and <a href=3D"https=
://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7f=
IEMgszcCSneHEA13-uHzzNLsl3ZqJFCJlFea30hVzAIvhmrnnr60KAtta4uiK9glBQq4EHCNpan=
gw11N9SgP2_tXjpGgNMUPH52uEyJR8zfRFOoPLHrpqtOh7PPht66WSS_zmCKxmCjd92vR7neqMu=
Ubv_po35DONVMbuzFwkqpReiIeFRvq_EWsEnW16Ik33QyFliZC4j2UJwc1EpbJ0nk7N0m2Z6qgw=
